## Home context

> Example fragment — edit to match your personal setup. The home
> profile is where machine-specific identifiers, personal email,
> homelab service names, etc. live. Maury's redaction rules
> (`.meta/rules.yaml`) prevent these from leaking into other
> profiles' rendered output.

- Personal email: `<your-personal-email>`.
- Default DNS / personal domain: `<your-personal-domain>`.
- Add the kind of home/personal context you'd want Claude to know
  about: homelab service names, hobby project paths, personal
  hardware quirks, etc.
